@host = http://localhost:5198
@token = paste-a-SalesRep-access-token-here

### Create an order — shop and quantities only (US-E4-1b resolves the rest)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "quantity": 3 },
    { "productId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Q4: a client price is ignored — the stored price is Catalog's
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 1 }
  ]
}

### List orders visible to the caller
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one order (includes the four verification steps)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
